(7650759, 1244694, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, painterly and hinting.  Fine composition.  The overlay, or whatever, is quite effective.  I like how the yellow predominates, a suffusion of hazy sunlight.  Like walking into a dream.<br/>One of two personal favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely image, painterly and hinting.  Fine composition.  The overlay, or whatever, is quite effective.  I like how the yellow predominates, a suffusion of hazy sunlight.  Like walking into a dream.One of two personal favorites in the challenge.', '2020-01-18 16:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650767, 1244599, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific balance in its entirety, the people as they come and go, and the boats and ships serenely moored.  No rushing along, scurrying out of the frame.  Matter-of-fact beauty.  So much to teach us.<br/>One of two personal favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Terrific balance in its entirety, the people as they come and go, and the boats and ships serenely moored.  No rushing along, scurrying out of the frame.  Matter-of-fact beauty.  So much to teach us.One of two personal favorites in the challenge.', '2020-01-18 16:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
