(7650775, 1244752, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautifully choreographed dance of lemons. I like everything about this, the colors, the composition, lighting and technicality. One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully choreographed dance of lemons. I like everything about this, the colors, the composition, lighting and technicality. One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2020-01-18 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
