(7650784, 1244599, 3306, '<td valign="top">An everyday picture with a lot of interest. Its always intriguing to imagine how people of other nationalities live. I wish you would give a description of what is going on here. So much to see and wonder.</td>', 'An everyday picture with a lot of interest. Its always intriguing to imagine how people of other nationalities live. I wish you would give a description of what is going on here. So much to see and wonder.', '2020-01-18 18:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
