(7651018, 1244676, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sunny and fun.  Great execution of a clever idea.  Blue carries the day.  They must tickle.</td>', 'Sunny and fun.  Great execution of a clever idea.  Blue carries the day.  They must tickle.', '2020-01-21 08:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651019, 1244318, 173844, '<td valign="top">Agatha Christie territory.  The fog seems to loosen up time, a blanket of memory and possibility.  I like how much space is devoted to it.  The gold onion dome in the lower right keeps drawing the eye, a curious feint of attention, deepening the sense of disorientation.</td>', 'Agatha Christie territory.  The fog seems to loosen up time, a blanket of memory and possibility.  I like how much space is devoted to it.  The gold onion dome in the lower right keeps drawing the eye, a curious feint of attention, deepening the sense of disorientation.', '2020-01-21 08:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651020, 1244752, 173844, '<td valign="top">A still life that has verve.  It''s also, besides being a wonderful traditional still life, amusing and has a trajectory.  The yellow, blue, green and terra cotta are symphonic.  The lizard on the branch is wonderful, boosting the charm factor even further.  My favorite part of the image is the bottle, so delicately colored, and with a translucent solidity that''s almost visceral.  Transcends the genre.</td>', 'A still life that has verve.  It''s also, besides being a wonderful traditional still life, amusing and has a trajectory.  The yellow, blue, green and terra cotta are symphonic.  The lizard on the branch is wonderful, boosting the charm factor even further.  My favorite part of the image is the bottle, so delicately colored, and with a translucent solidity that''s almost visceral.  Transcends the genre.', '2020-01-21 09:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651021, 1244725, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine evocation of the city.  The red, spiky building and its attendant bokeh add whimsy and rhythm, a la Joan Miro.  The water drops subtly enhance the fantasy.  There have been several images of Dubai on DPC --  this one''s my favorite.</td>', 'Fine evocation of the city.  The red, spiky building and its attendant bokeh add whimsy and rhythm, a la Joan Miro.  The water drops subtly enhance the fantasy.  There have been several images of Dubai on DPC --  this one''s my favorite.', '2020-01-21 09:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651022, 1244678, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a great "capture" -- strange way to express it.  Utterly endearing.  The dog and his or her beloved, I suppose, shoe are a counterpoint to the overall rhythm of the image, a flute among the cellos.  What''s up?  Everyday commute?  Tracking a perp?  Nice focus and exposure, perfect in black and white.  Fine image.</td>', 'What a great "capture" -- strange way to express it.  Utterly endearing.  The dog and his or her beloved, I suppose, shoe are a counterpoint to the overall rhythm of the image, a flute among the cellos.  What''s up?  Everyday commute?  Tracking a perp?  Nice focus and exposure, perfect in black and white.  Fine image.', '2020-01-21 09:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651029, 1244644, 38032, '<td valign="top">certainly expect to see this one on the front page. Both artistic and commercial feeling. 8</td>', 'certainly expect to see this one on the front page. Both artistic and commercial feeling. 8', '2020-01-21 10:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651030, 1244071, 38032, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2020-01-21 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651052, 1244753, 173844, '<td valign="top">The milky yellow sky perfectly brings out the filigree of trees.  Handsomely alien.</td>', 'The milky yellow sky perfectly brings out the filigree of trees.  Handsomely alien.', '2020-01-21 15:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651053, 1244686, 173844, '<td valign="top">The fine overlay lifts this beyond a photo of artwork.  Deft, imaginative touch that in itself is so enjoyable.</td>', 'The fine overlay lifts this beyond a photo of artwork.  Deft, imaginative touch that in itself is so enjoyable.', '2020-01-21 15:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651055, 1244755, 173844, '<td valign="top">The ghostly train is perfect, as is the tilt.  Strong imbalanced rhythm and quirky composition.  Great title.  Impressively successful.</td>', 'The ghostly train is perfect, as is the tilt.  Strong imbalanced rhythm and quirky composition.  Great title.  Impressively successful.', '2020-01-21 15:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651056, 1244158, 173844, '<td valign="top">Graphically excellent.  The elements meld together with panache (using which word always gives me a frisson, etc.).  The only part I''m unsure about are the three crooked brown lines on the right.  I guess they''re poinsettia branches, but it''s a bit Medusa for me.  Unless that''s your coy intention.  All in all, though, an accomplished achievement.</td>', 'Graphically excellent.  The elements meld together with panache (using which word always gives me a frisson, etc.).  The only part I''m unsure about are the three crooked brown lines on the right.  I guess they''re poinsettia branches, but it''s a bit Medusa for me.  Unless that''s your coy intention.  All in all, though, an accomplished achievement.', '2020-01-21 15:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651057, 1244209, 173844, '<td valign="top">The strong central placement of the tower is nicely softened by the sun close by at 45 degrees.  The scattered birds have an appealing scratchy ink feel.  I like the darkness of the water but for the sun''s weak reflection.  The orange sky is somewhat unworldly, a sci-fi twist.  Fine stuff.</td>', 'The strong central placement of the tower is nicely softened by the sun close by at 45 degrees.  The scattered birds have an appealing scratchy ink feel.  I like the darkness of the water but for the sun''s weak reflection.  The orange sky is somewhat unworldly, a sci-fi twist.  Fine stuff.', '2020-01-21 15:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
