(7651125, 1244404, 173844, '<td valign="top">Saw your title and thought, "yes."  She or he seems stylized, like an architectural embellishment on an old building.  Or a heraldry element.  There''s dignity and repose here, and complex beauty to feathers and form.  A noble head.  Wonderful choice of background.  Fine, engaging image.</td>', 'Saw your title and thought, "yes."  She or he seems stylized, like an architectural embellishment on an old building.  Or a heraldry element.  There''s dignity and repose here, and complex beauty to feathers and form.  A noble head.  Wonderful choice of background.  Fine, engaging image.', '2020-01-21 20:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651126, 1244739, 173844, '<td valign="top">The bare bones central scene is strong and intriguing.  All the surrounding foofaraw adds to the mood of mystery and displacement, and works well.  Black and white carries the mood to its extreme.  I like the blown out white expanse, as if a space ship has just lifted off.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-01-22 08:26:44.</i></td>', 'The bare bones central scene is strong and intriguing.  All the surrounding foofaraw adds to the mood of mystery and displacement, and works well.  Black and white carries the mood to its extreme.  I like the blown out white expanse, as if a space ship has just lifted off.', '2020-01-21 21:08:31.000000', '2020-01-22 08:26:44.000000', 1),
